    {
      "text": "###Insert into table\n\n```\nINSERT INTO TABLE tablename1 \n[PARTITION (partcol1=val1, partcol2=val2 ...)] \nselect_statement1 FROM from_statement;\n```",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
