    },
    {
      "text": "a. mapred.map.tasks - The default number of map tasks per job is 2. Ignored when mapred.job.tracker is \"local\". You can modify using set mapred.map.tasks = <value>\n\n\nb. mapred.reduce.tasks - The default number of reduce tasks per job is 1. Typically set to 99% of the cluster's reduce capacity, so that if a node fails the reduces can still be executed in a single wave. Ignored when mapred.job.tracker is \"local\". you can modify using set mapred.reduce.tasks = <value>",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
