    {
      "text": "\n#### Using Variable in Hive Scripts\n#####Hive stores variables in four different namespaces, namespace is a way to separate variables.\n1.  config variables( hiveconf)\n2.  customer variables (hivevar)\n3.  system variables (system)\n4.  Environment variables (env)",
