      "text": "%spark\n//ORC fileformate is compatible with ACID properties\n\n\nset hive.support.concurrency=true\nset hive.enfore.bucketing=true\nhive.exec.dynamic.partition.mode=nonstrict\nhive.txn.manager=\n\n\n\n",
