      "text": "\n%sql\n--connect to hive and run below\nLOAD DATA INPATH '/FileStore/tables/suankiData/raw/emp_copy.csv' INTO TABLE stg_db.suanki_employee_stg;\n\n-- /**\n-- INFO  : Starting task [Stage-0:MOVE] in serial mode\n-- INFO  : Loading data to table f1sfdld.employee_demo from hdfs://chcdpd2/apps/f1sfdld/warehouse/demo/emp.csv\n-- INFO  : Starting task [Stage-1:STATS] in serial mode\n-- INFO  : Executing stats task\n-- INFO  : Table f1sfdld.employee_demo stats: [numFiles=1, numRows=0, totalSize=3778, rawDataSize=0, numFilesErasureCoded=0]\n-- INFO  : Table f1sfdld.employee_demo stats: [numFiles=1, numRows=0, totalSize=3778, rawDataSize=0, numFilesErasureCoded=0]\n-- INFO  : Completed executing command(queryId=chd1hive_20240416074136_777e597a-c2e3-42c8-a0fe-bbe0dfde4870); Time taken: 0.72 seconds\n-- INFO  : OK\n\n\n-- --> file will be removed from warehouse location and copied to employee_demo location\n-- **/",
