    {
      "text": "\n###HS2\n\nHiveServer2 (HS2) is a service that enables clients to execute queries against Hive. HiveServer2 is the successor to HiveServer1 which has been deprecated. HS2 supports multi-client concurrency and authentication. It is designed to provide better support for open API clients like JDBC and ODBC.\n\nHS2 is a single process running as a composite service, which includes the Thrift-based Hive service (TCP or HTTP) and a Jetty web server for web UI. ",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
