    {
      "text": "%sql\nselect * from retail_db.orders\nwhere not exists(\n  select 1 from retail_db.order_item\n  where order_item.order_item_order_id = orders.order_id\n)\nlimit 5\n\n--co-related subqueries",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/sql",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "sql",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "b9fce225626948c99d804"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\nLets take a scenario Where table size is: 2300 MB, HDFS Block Size: 128 MB\n\nNow, Divide 2300/128=17.96\n\nNow, remember number of bucket will always be in the power of 2.\n\nSo we need to find n such that 2^n > 17.96\n\nn=5\n\nSo, I am going to use number of buckets as 2^5=32\n\n2*2 =4\n4*2 = 8\n8 * 2 = 16  closese to 17  so  2^5",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "c82d0162455e409e90573"
    },
