    {
      "text": "###How to create temporary table \n\n####NOTE: \n  1.  temprorary table in hive only available for current session \n  2. data in temp table gets stored under /tmp/hive/<user> on hdfs\n  3. if you create temp table with same name as final table , you can't access final unless you drop the temp table\n  4. does not support partitions",
