    {
      "text": "###Hive Metastore Server (HMS)\nThe Hive Metastore (HMS) is a central repository of metadata for Hive tables and partitions in a relational database, and provides clients (including Hive, Impala and Spark) access to this information using the metastore service API. It has become a building block for data lakes that utilize the diverse world of open-source software, such as Apache Spark and Presto. In fact, a whole ecosystem of tools, open-source and otherwise, are built around the Hive Metastore, some of which this diagram illustrates.",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "1f98057f4eaa4eb588450"
    },
    {
      "text": "%sql\nINSERT INTO stg_db.suanki_employee_stg values(141,'Joshua','Patel','JPATEL','650.121.1834','06-APR-06','ST_CLERK','2500', '-' ,'123','50');\n\n\nINSERT INTO stg_db.suanki_employee_stg values\n(142,'demo','Patel','JPATEL','650.121.1834','06-APR-06','ST_CLERK','2500', '-' ,'123','50'),\n(143,'demo_one','Patel','JPATEL','650.121.1834','06-APR-06','ST_CLERK','2500', '-' ,'123','50');\n\n-- /**\n-- INFO  : Query Execution Summary\n-- INFO  : ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n-- INFO  : OPERATION                            DURATION\n-- INFO  : ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n-- INFO  : Compile Query                           0.29s\n-- INFO  : Prepare Plan                            0.09s\n-- INFO  : Get Query Coordinator (AM)              0.00s\n-- INFO  : Submit Plan                             0.07s\n-- INFO  : Start DAG                               0.02s\n-- INFO  : Run DAG                                 4.03s\n-- INFO  : ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n-- INFO  : \n-- INFO  : Task Execution Summary\n\n-- **/",
      "config": {
